<header>
  <div class="mb-6 flex animate-intro flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-y-2">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3">
      <img
        src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62744899?v=4"
        alt="Shreyas Londhe"
        width="40"
        height="40"
        class="rounded-full transition-shadow hover:ring-2 hover:ring-blue-400/50"
        loading="eager"
        draggable="false"
      />
      <h1 class="font-semibold">Shreyas Londhe</h1>
    </div>
    <nav class="space-x-3">
      <a href="/projects" class="exclude relative text-neutral-500 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-current after:transition-[width] after:duration-200 hover:after:w-full"
        >Projects</a
      >
      <a href="/publications" class="exclude relative text-neutral-500 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-current after:transition-[width] after:duration-200 hover:after:w-full"
        >Publications</a
      >
      <a href="/writing" class="exclude relative text-neutral-500 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-current after:transition-[width] after:duration-200 hover:after:w-full"
        >Writing</a
      >
    </nav>
  </div>
  <p
    class="animate-intro font-light leading-snug opacity-0 [animation-delay:0.2s]"
  >
    Applied cryptographer working on zero-knowledge proof systems. Core
    contributor at <a
      href="https://prove.email"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer">ZkEmail</a
    >; research on ZK regex (<a href="/publications">PoPETs 2026</a>). Lately
    contributing to Jolt, WHIR, and ProveKit. Based in India.
  </p>
</header>
